            "notes": "Starting off the round I go with  [Armored Vest](item_358361e2-59be-4c81-b221-8a87f37809e6) for survivability,   [Compensator](item_2a354f80-610c-4661-9bdd-8960ae1a60b0)  to increase my healing amount, and  [Weapon Grease](item_961ae72f-434f-406b-a89b-ab8efec806bf) to increase my heal speed. I go with these 3 for almost every character I play. It uses all the starting cash so I can sell it all later.\n\nI choose  [Threads of Fate](item_cb61612b-9d83-49a9-989d-013bf084fbcb) so I can get almost 2x the ult charge while healing. For the first round I prioritize dmg boost since most characters are still relatively weak during this round. I don't pull out my gun a lot other than to secure low hp kills. I play much more defensively in this round compared to the next ones.",
