            "notes": "This is where I start to dps a bit more.\n\nIf you are low on cash, you might have to sell  [Armored Vest](item_358361e2-59be-4c81-b221-8a87f37809e6) or even [Weapon Grease](item_961ae72f-434f-406b-a89b-ab8efec806bf) to get [Advanced Nanobiotics](item_26fcf7c9-b81a-4d8e-a459-b515519cb73e) which will increase your healing & attack speed after healing an ally- and  [Talon Modification Module](item_c0ca1795-a3ea-4dc9-ae17-f34122574b3a) which will allow you to do more healing and damage. If you have left over cash, I would either buy back  [Armored Vest](item_358361e2-59be-4c81-b221-8a87f37809e6) or I would buy  [Mid-Air Mobilizer](item_760c1441-8cfa-426c-885d-8d0dec32e145) if I have the cash. \n\nI start pulling out my pistol a little bit more, but I don't go to overboard, I'm mainly jsut focusing on healing and dmg boosting here.",
