            "created_at": "2025-09-01T20:55:31.896309+00:00",
            "notes": "For the power, I go with  [Crepuscular Circle](item_c0b93ed2-b692-44d5-a38a-ce5a63e83cdb). This allows me to play much more aggressively during Valk and doesn't restrict me. \n\nI combo it with  [Blessed Boosters](item_957fd380-b7b4-40d4-8333-bb8c535ca931) so I can have better movement & range that can allow me to get out of stickier situations now that I'm starting to be more aggro. If I have any leftover cash, just like last round I'll get  [Mid-Air Mobilizer](item_760c1441-8cfa-426c-885d-8d0dec32e145) if I have the leftover cash.\n\nI play way more aggro then before, the moment I get Valk I pop it and start blasting. With the healing & damage boost being automatically applied thanks to  [Crepuscular Circle](item_c0b93ed2-b692-44d5-a38a-ce5a63e83cdb), I can fully focus on damaging & rezzing if needed.",
