            "notes": "This is where she starts to get really good at being aggro. If I have to, I'll sell something I previously had, especially since I usually buy back the 1,000 cash items so I can sell them again for the cash (I hate wasting cash). I'll end up buying  [Eye of the Spider](item_bbaf01d7-340d-4199-b738-86a98d68fe9b) to increase my damage and healing output. Then, if I have the extra cash I'll sell  [Advanced Nanobiotics](item_26fcf7c9-b81a-4d8e-a459-b515519cb73e) for  [Amari's Antidote](item_67e0b1c5-3bcb-4ab5-b818-5082e5706124). \n\nOnce again, I go crazy with my blaster and prioritize dmg & elims during my ult.",
