            "notes": "Now for the power, I'll choose  [Battle Medic](item_ccd0edff-4d57-4ac2-83a7-bab6ff0ffb2f). I'm actually very fond of battle medic because not only does it apply attack speed for you to go crazy with your blaster, but it also increases you HEALING attack speed too. This is awesome because when you swap or reload the effect will go away, but while your healing you can have 10 stacks of attack speed the whole time, allowing you to maximize your healing output.\n\nAnother really nice thing about this power is that since it's attack speed, you really don't need to have good aim for you do do some dmg and get elims.\n\nI'll then buy  [The Closer](item_173c6d0f-dbe6-440e-924f-0ce08189ddce) for more dmg output. I feel like headshots are really easy to get with mercy so the increased crit dmg is really nice.",
